msgid ""
"### Q: How do the W4A4C8 ultra-low-bit quantized weights preserve accuracy?"
msgstr ""
"### 问：W4A4C8 超低位量化权重如何保持精度？ {: #q-how-do-the-w4a4c8-ultra-low-bit-quantized-"
"weights-preserve-accuracy }"

msgid ""
"A: For 950PR&950DT Products, the W4A4C8 weights of GLM-5.2 are quantized "
"with "
"[msmodelslim](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/blob/master/lab_practice/glm_5_2/glm_5_2_w4a4c8_mxfp4.yaml)."
" The quantization pipeline first applies QuaRot rotation and FlexSmoothQuant"
" smoothing to suppress activation outliers, and then quantizes the model "
"with a mixed-precision strategy: only the modules that dominate the "
"parameter count are quantized to 4 bit, while precision-sensitive modules "
"fall back to higher precision or are not quantized at all."
msgstr ""
"A: 对于 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品，GLM-5.2 的 W4A4C8 权重使用 "
"[msmodelslim](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/blob/master/lab_practice/glm_5_2/glm_5_2_w4a4c8_mxfp4.yaml)"
" 进行量化。量化流程首先应用 QuaRot 旋转和 FlexSmoothQuant "
"平滑来抑制激活值离群点，然后采用混合精度策略对模型进行量化：仅将占参数数量主导地位的模块量化为 4 "
"bit，而对精度敏感的模块则回退到更高精度或完全不量化。"

msgid "| Module | Quantization configuration |"
msgstr "| 模块 | 量化配置 |"

msgid "| MoE FFN routed experts (`mlp.experts`) | W4A4 MXFP4 |"
msgstr "| MoE FFN 路由专家（`mlp.experts`） | W4A4 MXFP4 |"

msgid ""
"| Attention linear layers (except `kv_b_proj`, `wk`, `weights_proj`) | W8A8 "
"MXFP8 |"
msgstr "| Attention 线性层（`kv_b_proj`、`wk`、`weights_proj` 除外） | W8A8 MXFP8 |"

msgid "| Dense FFN linear layers (except router gates) | W8A8 MXFP8 |"
msgstr "| Dense FFN 线性层（router gates 除外） | W8A8 MXFP8 |"

msgid ""
"| Router gates, `kv_b_proj`, `wk`, `weights_proj` | Not quantized (kept in "
"high precision) |"
msgstr "| Router gates、`kv_b_proj`、`wk`、`weights_proj` | 不量化（保持高精度） |"

msgid ""
"- **Quantization algorithm**: The weights and activations use the MXFP4/MXFP8 microscaling formats. Each tensor is divided into blocks of 32 elements, and each block shares a single scaling factor obtained with symmetric min-max calibration on a chain-of-thought calibration dataset. Combined with the QuaRot/FlexSmoothQuant outlier suppression, block-wise scaling adapts to the local dynamic range of each tensor, so the quantization error is far lower than that of uniform INT4 quantization.\n"
"- **C8 (FP8 KV cache)**: C8 is a dynamic quantization applied to the KV cache during inference. On 950PR&950DT Products, the KV cache is quantized to FP8 (not INT8). It is unrelated to the parameters stored in the weight checkpoint and is controlled only by the serving configuration:\n"
"    - **Attention KV cache** (SFA C8, enabled with `--kv-cache-dtype fp8`): the compressed KV latent, which serves as both K and V, is dynamically quantized per 128-element tile to FP8 (E4M3) with a per-tile scale; the RoPE part of the KV cache stays in BF16, and Q is not quantized.\n"
"    - **Indexer cache** (LI C8, enabled with `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8`): both indexer Q and K are first rotated by a 128-dimensional Hadamard matrix to spread outliers, and then dynamically quantized per token to FP8 (E4M3) with per-token FP32 scales.\n"
"    - Precision-sensitive modules (the indexer and some attention layers) are configured as C8 fallback layers in the quantization configuration: they are excluded from C8 quantization during inference and run in high precision."
msgstr ""
"- **量化算法**：权重和激活值使用 MXFP4/MXFP8 微缩放格式。每个张量被划分为 32 个元素的块，每个块共享一个缩放因子，该因子通过在思维链校准数据集上进行对称 min-max 校准获得。结合 QuaRot/FlexSmoothQuant 离群点抑制，逐块缩放能够适应每个张量的局部动态范围，因此量化误差远低于均匀 INT4 量化。\n"
"- **C8（FP8 KV cache）**：C8 是推理过程中应用于 KV cache 的动态量化。在 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品上，KV cache 被量化为 FP8（而非 INT8）。它与权重 checkpoint 中存储的参数无关，仅由服务配置控制：\n"
"    - **Attention KV cache**（SFA C8，通过 `--kv-cache-dtype fp8` 启用）：压缩后的 KV latent（同时作为 K 和 V）按 128 元素 tile 动态量化为 FP8（E4M3），并带有 per-tile scale；KV cache 的 RoPE 部分保持 BF16，Q 不量化。\n"
"    - **Indexer cache**（LI C8，通过 `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8` 启用）：indexer 的 Q 和 K 首先通过 128 维 Hadamard 矩阵进行旋转以分散离群点，然后按 token 动态量化为 FP8（E4M3），并带有 per-token FP32 scale。\n"
"    - 精度敏感的模块（indexer 和部分 attention 层）在量化配置中被配置为 C8 回退层：它们在推理过程中被排除在 C8 量化之外，以高精度运行。"

