msgid ""
"- `--data-parallel-size 2` and `--tensor-parallel-size 8` define both\n"
"      roles. Each role spans two nodes, with one TP8 engine per node and\n"
"      a separate DP group. Each node exposes API port `8000`.\n"
"    - Prefill sets `enable_kvpp: true` in `--additional-config`;\n"
"      Decode sets `--decode-context-parallel-size 8` to shard KV cache\n"
"      across its TP group.\n"
"    - `--max-model-len` is `1046576` on Prefill and `1048576` on Decode.\n"
"      Prefill sets `--max-num-seqs 64` and\n"
"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 32768`; Decode sets `32` and `192`,\n"
"      respectively. Tune concurrency for the available KV cache capacity.\n"
"    - MTP uses `deepseek_mtp` with an eager draft: one speculative token\n"
"      on Prefill and five on Decode. Prefill uses `--enforce-eager`;\n"
"      Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode.\n"
"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` uses `kv_producer` on Prefill and `kv_consumer`\n"
"      on Decode, with base KV ports `30000` and `30200`, respectively.\n"
"      Both roles declare Prefill DP2/TP8 and Decode DP2/TP8.\n"
"    - Both roles use FP8 attention and indexer KV caches and\n"
"      `enable_fused_mc2: 1`. Prefill also enables DSA CP, FlashComm1 and\n"
"      prefix caching."
msgstr ""
"- `--data-parallel-size 2` 和 `--tensor-parallel-size 8` 定义两个角色。每角色跨两个节点，每节点一个 TP8 引擎，各角色有独立 DP 组；每节点提供 API 端口 `8000`。\n"
"    - Prefill 在 `--additional-config` 中设置 `enable_kvpp: true`；Decode 设置 `--decode-context-parallel-size 8`，在 TP 组中分片 KV 缓存。\n"
"    - Prefill 的 `--max-model-len` 为 `1046576`，Decode 为 `1048576`。Prefill 设置 `--max-num-seqs 64`、`--max-num-batched-tokens 32768`，Decode 分别为 `32`、`192`。应按可用 KV 缓存容量调整并发。\n"
"    - MTP 使用 `deepseek_mtp` 和 eager 草稿模型：Prefill 为 1 个推测 Token，Decode 为 5 个。Prefill 使用 `--enforce-eager`，Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。\n"
"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` 在 Prefill 使用 `kv_producer`，Decode 使用 `kv_consumer`，基础 KV 端口分别为 `30000`、`30200`；两端均声明 Prefill DP2/TP8、Decode DP2/TP8。\n"
"    - 两端均使用 FP8 注意力及索引器 KV 缓存和 `enable_fused_mc2: 1`。Prefill 还启用 DSA CP、FlashComm1 与前缀缓存。"

msgid ""
"This configuration uses GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 weights on four A3 series\n"
"    nodes, with 16 logical NPU devices per node. Use the A3 image from\n"
"    [Docker Image Installation](#4-installation) on all nodes.\n"
"    The maximum context length is 1,048,576 tokens, including input and output."
msgstr ""
"本配置在 4 个 A3 系列节点上使用 GLM-5.3 W8A8C8 权重，每节点 16 个逻辑 NPU 设备。全部节点均使用 [Docker "
"镜像安装](#4-installation)中的 A3 镜像。最大上下文长度为 1,048,576 Token，包含输入与输出。"

msgid "Send requests to `<PROXY_IP>:8000` using the served model name `glm`."
msgstr "使用模型服务名 `glm` 向 `<PROXY_IP>:8000` 发送请求。"

msgid ""
"All serving commands on this page use `--served-model-name glm`, including "
"GLM-5.3. For colocated deployment, use the API-facing node and its "
"configured HTTP port. For PD deployment, use the proxy host and port `8000`;"
" do not send client requests to a headless worker."
msgstr ""
"本页所有服务命令均使用 `--served-model-name glm`，GLM-5.3 也不例外。同机部署请访问提供 API 的节点及其配置的 "
"HTTP 端口；PD 部署请访问代理主机的 `8000` 端口，不要将客户端请求发给无 API 工作进程。"

msgid ""
"Expected result: HTTP 200 with a JSON `choices` array containing generated "
"text and `usage` statistics. The following is an illustrative response, not "
"a captured test result; generated text, IDs, timing, token counts, and "
"optional fields vary."
msgstr ""
"预期结果为 HTTP 200，JSON 响应包含生成文本的 `choices` 数组及 `usage` "
"统计。下方仅为示例响应，并非捕获的测试结果；实际文本、ID、耗时、Token 数和可选字段可能不同。"

msgid ""
"An HTTP error, startup failure, or empty/invalid response is not a "
"successful verification. Retain the startup command, runtime versions, image"
" digest, server log, and actual HTTP response with the result."
msgstr "HTTP 错误、启动失败或空白/无效响应不算验证成功。请随结果保留启动命令、运行时版本、镜像摘要、服务日志和实际 HTTP 响应。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Using AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md).\n"
"Use the same checkpoint, hardware, deployment topology and generation\n"
"settings when comparing results. Scores are specific to the model shown."
msgstr ""
"参阅[使用 "
"AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md)。比较结果时，应使用相同权重、硬件、部署拓扑和生成参数。分数仅对应表中注明的模型。"

msgid "### 7.3 W4A4C8 950DT products Validation Records"
msgstr ""
"### 7.3 W4A4C8 950DT products 验证记录 {: #73-w4a4c8-950dt-products-validation-"
"records }"

msgid ""
"Both records below use one 950DT products (96GB × 8), the 2026-10-08 950DT products\n"
"image, TP8/DP1/EP, eager mode, a configured maximum\n"
"context of 135000, 16384 batched tokens, 20 sequences and FP8 KV/indexer\n"
"caches. On 2026-10-10, `/health`, `/v1/chat/completions` and\n"
"`/v1/completions` returned HTTP 200 for both local checkpoints.\n"
"This verifies startup and short requests, not actual 135k inputs,\n"
"tool use or performance. The historical command used `--reasoning-parser glm45`;\n"
"the shared commands now use `glm47` to align with GLM-5.3. That parser\n"
"update has not been revalidated on NPU hardware in this documentation update."
msgstr ""
"下方两条记录均使用 1 个 950DT products（96GB × 8）节点、2026-10-08 镜像、TP8/DP1/EP 和 eager "
"模式，配置上下文上限 135000、批处理 Token 数 16384、20 个序列及 FP8 注意力/索引器 KV "
"缓存。2026-10-10，两个本地权重的 `/health`、`/v1/chat/completions` 和 `/v1/completions` "
"均返回 HTTP 200。这验证了启动及短请求，未验证实际 135k 输入、工具使用或性能。历史命令使用 `--reasoning-parser "
"glm45`，当前共有命令为对齐 GLM-5.3 改用 `glm47`。本次文档更新尚未在 NPU 硬件上重新验证此解析器调整。"

msgid ""
"The GLM-5.3 GSM8K run used zero-shot chat, numeric exact match on the\n"
"content field, `temperature=0`, `seed=42`, `max_tokens=8192`, concurrency\n"
"20, a 900-second timeout and no retries. All 1319 samples were attempted;\n"
"1309 requests finished normally and 10 failed. The score includes those\n"
"10 errors in the denominator. It is a local-checkpoint result, not GPQA\n"
"or an AISBench benchmark result, and does not establish a throughput gate.\n"
"The local checkpoint was not matched to a public release revision or\n"
"verified by per-shard hashes."
msgstr ""
"GLM-5.3 的 GSM8K 运行使用零样本聊天，针对内容字段进行数值精确匹配，参数为 "
"`temperature=0`、`seed=42`、`max_tokens=8192`，并发 20，超时 900 秒且不重试。全部 1319 "
"个样本均已发起请求；1309 次正常完成，10 次失败。计算分数时分母包含这 10 次错误。这是本地权重结果，不是 GPQA 或 AISBench "
"基准结果，也不构成吞吐量门槛。本地权重未与公开发布版本匹配，也未逐分片校验哈希。"

msgid ""
"The following settings summarize the hardware-specific deployment scripts in\n"
"Sections 5.1 and 5.2. Global DP includes all nodes within one DP group;\n"
"independent instances are listed per instance. Local DP is the number of\n"
"ranks on one node. Scheduler limits are per engine."
msgstr ""
"下表汇总第 5.1、5.2 节中各硬件的部署脚本设置。全局 DP 包含一个 DP 组内的全部节点，独立实例按单实例列出；本地 DP 指一个节点上的 "
"rank 数。调度限制按引擎生效。"

msgid ""
"The A3 performance reference covers the following workloads.\n"
"Lengths use `input/output` notation. The 1M A3 case uses one concurrent\n"
"request; reserve output tokens within the 1,048,576-token context limit."
msgstr ""
"A3 性能参考涵盖下列负载。长度采用 `input/output` 表示输入/输出。A3 1M 场景并发为 1，需在 1,048,576 Token "
