msgid "### 9.3 TurboQuant KV Cache for GLM-5.2 and GLM-5.3"
msgstr "### 9.3 GLM-5.2 与 GLM-5.3 的 TurboQuant KV 缓存"

msgid ""
"Use a build of the selected 0.30 maintenance branch containing the packed\n"
"SFA TurboQuant support. This SFA path supports model runner V1; it does\n"
"not require switching the V1 reference deployments to runner V2.\n"
"Use `--dtype bfloat16` on A2/A3 and disable xLite graph mode."
msgstr ""
"请使用所选 0.30 维护分支中包含打包 SFA TurboQuant 支持的构建。此 SFA 路径支持 V1 模型运行器，无需将 V1 参考部署切换到"
" V2。在 A2/A3 上使用 `--dtype bfloat16` 并禁用 xLite 图模式。"

msgid ""
"`--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc` replaces the int8 attention KV cache\n"
"and cannot be combined with `enable_sparse_sfa_c8: true`.\n"
"It does not support context parallelism (DCP/PCP), so it must not be\n"
"enabled in the DCP-enabled 1M reference deployment in Section 5.2.\n"
"In PD deployments, set `\"use_ascend_direct\": false` on the Mooncake\n"
"connector on both roles, and keep the cache format consistent across\n"
"Prefill and Decode. Revalidate capacity and accuracy after changing it.\n"
"This option does not apply to the 950DT products FP8 examples or GLM-5.3-Flash."
msgstr ""
"`--kv-cache-dtype turboquant_4bit_nc` 替代 int8 注意力 KV 缓存，不能与 "
"`enable_sparse_sfa_c8: true` 同时使用。该选项不支持上下文并行（DCP/PCP），因此不能用于第 5.2 节启用 DCP 的"
" 1M 参考部署。PD 部署中，两端 Mooncake 连接器均应设置 `\"use_ascend_direct\": false`，并保持 "
"Prefill 与 Decode 的缓存格式一致。更改后需重新验证容量和精度。此选项不适用于 950DT products FP8 示例或 "
"GLM-5.3-Flash。"

