msgstr "=== \"Ascend 950DT系列产品\""

msgid "<a id=\"glm-common-parameters\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"glm-common-parameters\"></a>"

msgid "| Parameter | Meaning and constraints |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 含义与约束 |"

msgid ""
"| `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` | CANN/HCCL communication buffer size in MB; a positive "
"integer, with a documented default of 200. Larger buffers consume more "
"device memory, multiplied by the number of communication domains. Keep the "
"example's hardware/role-specific value and account for this memory when "
"sizing the KV cache. See the [CANN HCCL "
"reference](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/latest/API/hcclug/hcclenvref_07_0005.html)"
" for allocation details and version-specific constraints. |"
msgstr ""
"| `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` | CANN/HCCL 通信缓冲区大小，单位为 MB；取值为正整数，文档中给出的默认值为 "
"200。缓冲区越大，占用的设备内存越多，且会乘以通信域的数量。请保留示例中针对特定硬件/角色的取值，并在规划 KV cache "
"容量时考虑这部分内存开销。有关分配细节和特定版本的限制，请参阅 [CANN HCCL "
"参考](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/latest/API/hcclug/hcclenvref_07_0005.html)。"
" |"

msgid ""
"| `HCCL_IF_IP` and socket interface variables | Set the current node's "
"communication IP and matching network interface. Peers must be reachable "
"through the selected network. |"
msgstr ""
"| `HCCL_IF_IP` 及 socket 接口变量 | 设置当前节点的通信 IP 及匹配的网络接口。对端必须能够通过所选网络访问。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--data-parallel-size`, `--tensor-parallel-size`, `--pipeline-parallel-"
"size` | DP is the number of data-parallel ranks; TP and PP partition each "
"model engine across devices and pipeline stages. Follow the topology and "
"placement in the selected tab. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--data-parallel-size`、`--tensor-parallel-size`、`--pipeline-parallel-size`"
" | DP 是数据并行 rank 的数量；TP 和 PP 将每个模型引擎划分到多个设备和流水线阶段。请遵循所选标签页中的拓扑和部署方式。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-model-len` | Maximum total sequence length in tokens, including "
"input and generated output. Requests must fit this limit and the available "
"KV cache capacity. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--max-model-len` | 最大序列总长度（以 token 计），包括输入和生成的输出。请求必须满足此限制以及可用的 KV cache "
"容量。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-num-seqs`, `--max-num-batched-tokens` | Scheduler limits for "
"sequences and tokens processed in an iteration, respectively. These are per "
"engine, not aggregate proxy limits; tune them together with context length "
"and memory capacity. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--max-num-seqs`、`--max-num-batched-tokens` | 分别表示调度器在单次迭代中处理的序列数和 token "
"数的上限。这些限制针对单个引擎，而非代理的聚合限制；请结合上下文长度和内存容量一同调优。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--gpu-memory-utilization` | Fraction of device memory budgeted to the "
"model executor. Despite the flag name, it also applies to the NPU backend. "
"Leave room for communication buffers and other device allocations. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--gpu-memory-utilization` | 分配给模型执行器的设备内存比例。尽管该参数名称中包含 gpu，它同样适用于 NPU "
"后端。请为通信缓冲区和其他设备分配预留空间。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--quantization ascend` | Selects the Ascend quantization loader for "
"ModelSlim checkpoints. Use weights matching the selected hardware and "
"quantization format. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--quantization ascend` | 为 ModelSlim 检查点选择昇腾量化加载器。请使用与所选硬件和量化格式匹配的权重。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--kv-cache-dtype`, `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype` | Select the "
"attention and indexer KV cache formats. Follow the selected checkpoint and "
"hardware example; the supported formats differ across platforms. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--kv-cache-dtype`、`--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype` | 选择 attention 和 "
"indexer 的 KV cache 格式。请遵循所选检查点和硬件示例；不同平台支持的格式有所不同。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--tool-call-parser glm47`, `--enable-auto-tool-choice` | Parse tool calls"
" and allow automatic tool selection. Configure them on both API-serving "
"roles in a PD deployment. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--tool-call-parser glm47`、`--enable-auto-tool-choice` | 解析工具调用并允许自动选择工具。在"
" PD 部署中，需要在两个提供 API 服务的角色上都进行配置。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--reasoning-parser` | Separates reasoning from the final answer. Use the "
"parser in the selected example (`glm47` or `glm45`); do not infer it from "
"the tool-call parser name. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--reasoning-parser` | 将推理过程与最终答案分离。请使用所选示例中的解析器（`glm47` 或 "
"`glm45`）；不要根据工具调用解析器的名称来推断。 |"

