msgid ""
"For 950DT ordinary PD, the two independent PP2/TP8 Prefill instances use\n"
"four Prefill nodes in total (P0/P1 and P2/P3). The Prefill row below gives\n"
"DP1 and scheduler limits per instance; it does not combine them into a DP2\n"
"group. The single DP16/TP1 Decode group spans D0/D1. Pooling and 1M rows\n"
"refer to their own deployment topologies in Sections 5.1.4 and 5.2."
msgstr ""
"950DT 普通 PD 的两个独立 PP2/TP8 Prefill 实例共使用四个 Prefill 节点（P0/P1 和 P2/P3）。下方 "
"Prefill 行的 DP1 和调度限制均按单实例列出，不表示将两组组成 DP2 组。一个 DP16/TP1 Decode 组跨 D0/D1 "
"运行。池化和 1M 行分别对应第 5.1.4、5.2 节各自的部署拓扑。"

